(self.webpackChunksite=self.webpackChunksite||[]).push([[1600],{1655:t=>{"use strict";t.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"dungeon-of-shards","title":"Dungeon of Shards","authors":[{"name":"Giovana da Silva Bulc\xe3o","contact":"giovanabulcao","contactType":"github","contactUrl":"https://github.com/giovanabulcao"},{"name":"Cintia da Silva Bulc\xe3o","contact":"cintiasilva-blc","contactType":"github","contactUrl":"https://github.com/cintiasilva-blc"}],"date":1783555200000,"readme":"<p>Legend has it that a cursed maze deep underground hides six ancient shards... and Kiro, a hunter with a taste for cursed loot (and bad puns), just couldn\'t resist the rumor. The catch? The dungeon is crawling with angry mobs that won\'t take kindly to a stranger poking around their treasure.</p>\\n<p>Inspired by the classic maze games, Dungeon of Shards drops you into Kiro\'s boots as you explore the dark corridors, dodge whatever\'s guarding them, and try to grab all six shards before something catches you first.</p>\\n<p>Fast reflexes and a good sense of direction are your best weapons. <strong>Good luck!!</strong></p>\\n<h2>How to Play</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Collect the <strong>6 shards</strong> scattered across the maze.</li>\\n<li>If an enemy catches you, it\'s <strong>game over</strong>.</li>\\n<li>Some enemies patrol fixed routes, but start <strong>chasing</strong> the player once he gets close.</li>\\n<li>The exit is a <strong>flashing tile</strong> at the far end of the maze, it only unlocks victory once <strong>all 6 shards</strong> have been collected. Step on it too early and you\'ll just get a warning telling you shards are missing.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> the mobs guarding the dungeon aren\'t exactly geniuses... dodge them and grab the shards while they\'re not looking!</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<h2>Controls</h2>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>Button</th>\\n<th>Action</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>Arrows</td>\\n<td>Move through the maze</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>X</td>\\n<td>Confirm / Retry after game over or win</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<hr>\\n<p><em>This project was developed in C for the WASM-4 fantasy console by Computer Science students from UEM (State University of Maring\xe1), guided by their professor, Marcelo Malheiros.</em></p>"}')}}]);